    L_i=sqrt(kappa) epsilon^-1 j_i,
    V_N(r)=exp[r(-iH_N-kappa Gamma_N/(2epsilon^2))].

The notation C_S for compensation and C for S(S+1) follows the sources.
Hermitian energy is always H, never the dissipative generator. W counts A
