Write v4(s)=V4(s) U4 Omega and

    x_i(s,t)=V6(t-s)L_i v4(s).

The exact N=6 density is sum_i integral_0^t |x_i(s,t)><x_i(s,t)| ds.
The other blocks are |v4(t)><v4(t)| and the positive terminal N=8 block.
